                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "07529056-e1b1-34a5-9d5e-b386637c7d84",
                        "entry_id": "fb1ed90e-29aa-3a14-bee5-e542c832d396",
                        "glosses": [
                            "уменьш. к интрига; скрытные неблаговидные действия"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "61102c91-9b3b-4b54-8c89-300a048da14f",
                                "sense_id": "07529056-e1b1-34a5-9d5e-b386637c7d84",
                                "text": "Придётся по горло окунуться в море театральных и чиновнических дрязг, до тошноты надышаться этой гнилой атмосферы мелких интрижек, микроскопических, но ядовитых амбиций, всякого рода каверз и проявлений грубого самодурства."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "23a19d5d-4051-385b-b5de-f7ee947ab947",
                        "entry_id": "fb1ed90e-29aa-3a14-bee5-e542c832d396",
                        "glosses": [
                            "уменьш. к интрига; любовная связь"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0d42340-2f03-4ca5-9056-bdd7d1e2b4bf",
                                "sense_id": "23a19d5d-4051-385b-b5de-f7ee947ab947",
                                "text": "Связишки, интрижки и всякая такая гадость, — а любви нет."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "363536c9-e415-42c8-af72-f6e6947eb7dc",
                                "sense_id": "23a19d5d-4051-385b-b5de-f7ee947ab947",
                                "text": "Друг мой, я свободный человек, я не прочь приятно провести время, я не враг связей с женщинами, не враг даже благородных интрижек, но… с вами заводить мелкую интрижку, вас делать предметом своих праздных помыслов, вас, умную, прекрасную, свободную женщину?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16b51314-7176-4c27-a73a-3f9b757bbbde",
                                "sense_id": "23a19d5d-4051-385b-b5de-f7ee947ab947",
                                "text": "Пора растрясти нашу комедию, где интрижка за интрижку цепляется, а человека нет ни одного — все субретки французской комедии."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "940032c6-6d92-46da-ac2b-87c8b5b24576",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb1ed90e-29aa-3a14-bee5-e542c832d396",
                        "target_lang_word": "intrigue",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "intrigue",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "513d773f-7a4b-326a-8af5-522fb04d01f5",
                                        "entry_id": "4cbb5edb-f77f-3b33-bbf2-90993040512c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A complicated or clandestine plot or scheme intended to effect some purpose by secret artifice; conspiracy; stratagem."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e220614f-096a-40d0-9df0-67667a14f7dc",
                                                "sense_id": "513d773f-7a4b-326a-8af5-522fb04d01f5",
                                                "text": "[…] lost in such a jungle of intrigues, pettifoggings, treacheries, diplomacies domestic and foreign […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91459726-4891-38c0-a378-b5300d08bd9e",
                                        "entry_id": "4cbb5edb-f77f-3b33-bbf2-90993040512c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The plot of a play, poem or romance; the series of complications in which a writer involves their imaginary characters."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "394fe71d-5a19-3420-9138-ac083e0bec4a",
                                        "entry_id": "4cbb5edb-f77f-3b33-bbf2-90993040512c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Clandestine intercourse between persons; illicit intimacy; a liaison or affair."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "054af886-b6b0-4202-a1f3-bfccf25e4596",
                                                "sense_id": "394fe71d-5a19-3420-9138-ac083e0bec4a",
                                                "text": "I often used to smile at a young Ensign of the Guards, who always popped [pawned] his sword and watch when he wanted cash for an intrigue; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4931ea6-427d-4138-ae34-c0ad449c5895",
                                                "sense_id": "394fe71d-5a19-3420-9138-ac083e0bec4a",
                                                "text": "He proposed to call witnesses to show how the prisoner, a profligate and spendthrift, had been at the end of his financial tether, and had also been carrying on an intrigue with a certain Mrs. Raikes, a neighbouring farmer’s wife."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "967bfa8b-4c0d-4115-888d-4bedcf96146c",
                                                "sense_id": "394fe71d-5a19-3420-9138-ac083e0bec4a",
                                                "text": "In 1679 and 1680 there were persistent rumors of an intrigue between Mary, Lady Grey, and the Duke of Monmouth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "intrigue",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99cdc0ec-cf5f-3fe0-b664-c2ad7c9b82f6",
                                        "entry_id": "3939b1b8-0dc6-3b98-a696-92f62d51ac77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To conceive or carry out a secret plan intended to harm; to form a plot or scheme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eeb61f8f-03a7-3bff-b199-99cb63217e60",
                                        "entry_id": "3939b1b8-0dc6-3b98-a696-92f62d51ac77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To arouse the interest of; to fascinate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2b7de87-0d6a-42d5-bc6a-a6d775ca7c52",
                                                "sense_id": "eeb61f8f-03a7-3bff-b199-99cb63217e60",
                                                "text": "Scenic illusions such as those caused by the haze, or the apparent diminution of scale where everything was enormous, intrigued Dutton."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c511129-9cce-41cb-8fe3-3c873afd7c17",
                                                "sense_id": "eeb61f8f-03a7-3bff-b199-99cb63217e60",
                                                "text": "These pictorial devices are indispensable tools for presenting evidence, for explaining a theory, for telling a story. And, on top of all that, they are ornaments; they entice and intrigue and sometimes delight."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5768d75-c14f-3f27-8cc6-6d609ac6293f",
                                        "entry_id": "3939b1b8-0dc6-3b98-a696-92f62d51ac77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To have clandestine or illicit intercourse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0677dc4e-5f0e-3d86-a57b-39ea6ce74097",
                                        "entry_id": "3939b1b8-0dc6-3b98-a696-92f62d51ac77",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To fill with artifice and duplicity; to complicate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6db56ba9-4cb5-40ee-a5f5-b540e50ccd1b",
                                                "sense_id": "0677dc4e-5f0e-3d86-a57b-39ea6ce74097",
                                                "text": "And as wililye as thoſe ſhrewes that beguyle hym haue holpe hym to inuolue and intryke the matter: I ſhall vſe ſo playn and open a way therin, that euery man ſhall well ſee the trouth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "337473e9-af36-46ce-9eff-37e71aa4c64a",
                                                "sense_id": "0677dc4e-5f0e-3d86-a57b-39ea6ce74097",
                                                "text": "How doth it [sin] perplex and intrigue the whole course of your lives!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8b96ada0-fb18-44e2-93df-4a7db0b8ec28",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb1ed90e-29aa-3a14-bee5-e542c832d396",
                        "target_lang_word": "flirtation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "flirtation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "add72343-cbdd-3375-b1a0-1a344e5a4077",
                                        "entry_id": "a935b643-0cc4-323e-a572-24911910d6c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Playing at courtship; coquetry."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ffe4c28-cb45-4b81-8881-2f6da500140b",
                                                "sense_id": "add72343-cbdd-3375-b1a0-1a344e5a4077",
                                                "text": "The inquest on keeper Davidson was duly held, and at the commencement seemed likely to cause Tony Palliser less anxiety than he had expected. Northrop knew all about Tony's flirtation with Lucy Davidson, but it also knew a good deal more about that lady than Tony did, and exculpated him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "12684fbd-24ee-3749-b78d-7166ac79d2fe",
                                        "entry_id": "a935b643-0cc4-323e-a572-24911910d6c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of flirting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66c01379-2a8e-4fcc-b2e3-3b14d99a6c82",
                                                "sense_id": "12684fbd-24ee-3749-b78d-7166ac79d2fe",
                                                "text": "Courtenaye augured well from the profound silence; suddenly a burst of applause shook the house, the curtain had fallen, and Booth sprang to Walter's side, who was still engaged in an animated flirtation with an actress who was to play in the afterpiece."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e0eae276-c74f-3997-b992-558be462dba0",
                                        "entry_id": "a935b643-0cc4-323e-a572-24911910d6c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A period of experimentation with or interest in a particular idea or activity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e3ffe6e-6466-4b0a-9096-9c47bedee195",
                                                "sense_id": "e0eae276-c74f-3997-b992-558be462dba0",
                                                "text": "The elimination of vacuum-braked wagons would be slowed down, and the Western Region's flirtation with diesel-hydraulic locomotives was questioned."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
